        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Inox T2 Back-to-Back Pull Set, INX-PHIX33310 BTB</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe T2 Back-to-Back Pull Set is available in satin stainless steel, bright stainless steel, graphite black, flat black, stormy grey, and dark bronze. The Back-To-Back T2 Door Pull Pair comes packaged as a set of 2 door pulls with the hardware needed to mount them back to back on either side of a single door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Inox PHIX33310 BTB Back to Back Pull Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2) Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
